notes.content:
Hi everyone.

I know I've been absent here from Order from Caos community page, but it's because I'm working on Hidden Shelter and on another RPG project at the moment.

But, as I cannot be unaware of the feedbacks, I made some changes according to what I heard from you.

Joh can use the double attack move even though he has no sword equipped. It's fine to use the wrench;
The first meeting with Magdalene does not repeat itself anymore;
Forest south of the Prometheus mountain can no longer be accessed ahead of time, avoiding the bug that makes it impossible to catch the Prometheus summon;
It is now possible to get the Summon Prometheus;
Slight modification of Poison magic;
Hyper Attack costs 50TP;
Small change in Nilrem's magic (first encounter);
Player cannot proceed without getting into the car in Lorenzo;
Magdalene event crashing the game when it reaches the water fixed;
Some bugs fixed
Minor updates

I know I need to improve the English translation. I promise that I will do my best to correct whatever is necessary.
